---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'February 2026';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — StadiumStays"
  description="StadiumStays privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your data."
  noIndex={true}
>
  <div class="container-narrow py-12 lg:py-16">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-500 mb-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-300">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>StadiumStays ("we", "us", "our") is a hotel comparison and affiliate website for football fans in the UK. Our website is located at stadiumstays.com.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">2. What Data We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">We collect minimal personal data. Specifically:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-zinc-400">
          <li><strong class="text-zinc-300">Contact form submissions:</strong> Name, email address, and message content when you contact us.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-zinc-300">Analytics data:</strong> Anonymised usage data (pages visited, device type, approximate location) collected via analytics software.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-zinc-300">Cookies:</strong> We use essential cookies and, where consent is given, analytics cookies. See our cookie section below.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">3. Affiliate Links & Third Parties</h2>
        <p>StadiumStays contains affiliate links to hotel booking platforms including Booking.com. When you click these links and make a booking, the third-party site has its own privacy policy that applies. We may receive a commission on completed bookings. We do not share your personal data with affiliate partners.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">4. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5">
          <li>To respond to your contact form enquiries</li>
          <li>To improve our website based on anonymised analytics</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">5. Your Rights (UK GDPR)</h2>
        <p>Under UK GDPR, you have rights including: the right to access your data, the right to correction, the right to erasure, and the right to object to processing. To exercise these rights, <a href="/contact/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">contact us</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use essential cookies required for the website to function, and optional analytics cookies. Analytics cookies are only set with your consent. You can withdraw consent at any time by clearing your browser cookies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Contact form data is retained for up to 12 months. Analytics data is retained in anonymised form for up to 26 months.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related enquiries, please <a href="/contact/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">contact us</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
